OCR components

ShaiTu uses OCR capabilities supplied by the local Windows installation
(Windows.Media.Ocr and, when available, components installed with the
Microsoft Snipping Tool). Those Microsoft components are not included in
this repository or in ShaiTu release packages and remain subject to their
own terms. ShaiTu does not upload images or recognized text.
